  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: efcff2e8eebb3f548b4dd196a95532b0, type: 3}
  lines:
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Aduh... aduh aduh...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c5c20c6b8f4608740bbf8e9fc21885bb, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Hei, kamu baik-baik aja?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d80b00bdf5275674d866b08b335ca5ee, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: fb5651eb663a5824885466c711980a23, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Nggak tau deh. Tadi aku connect Wi-Fi, terus tiba-tiba browser-ku redirect
      ke halaman login yang aneh. Minta username sama password email.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 36b961fde6fcfa445a4e447138c70926, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Kamu connect ke Wi-Fi yang mana?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 374135691e906e34eab4c050fbd76c1c, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b3c771e03e9799b4f818e3cb2372726b, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Yang ini, FREE_CAFE_WIFI. Namanya mirip punya kafe kan? Aku kira sama.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a6b11a0ace19064e9f4cd0b14df481b, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Itu bukan nama yang dikasih barista tadi...
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 131cffbe83a6e8f45b731c3cabdc9c23, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b6e531dc76e4e324bb233bdcedb79558, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 2
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Hah? Serius? Terus aku harus gimana sekarang?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 875c0b1e2798bdf478a0ce289d20802c, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Pertama, disconnect sekarang. Jangan isi form apa pun. Ganti password email
      kamu dari perangkat lain yang aman.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8e0698028514ce84ea2925b2bbc6c5d6, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a0fecfbb6a7720c4ab11708ba0787c8a, type: 3}
  - speaker: 1
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Iya iya... makasih. Tapi Wi-Fi palsu itu dari mana ya?
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2f95c4e31d3270b4e96cbf0dfe5ba5e4, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 0}
  - speaker: 0
    mood: 0
    expression: {fileID: 0}
    text: Aku coba cari tahu. Kamu tunggu di sini dulu.
    voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b8f0c1885771ecd4ca9415eb7108b494, type: 3}
    femalePlayerVoiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 806ce4d3764764c4d8376a9ac92e44b1, type: 3}
  hasChoice: 0
  acceptText: Ya
  rejectText: Tidak
  dialogueIfAccepted: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueIfRejected: {fileID: 0}
  actionID: VN_Topic5_Rina
